WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Build behavioral stories that land. Use a simple story structure to show what you owned, how you decided, and what changed because of it.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Situation. Set the scene quickly. Give only the context the listener needs to understand the challenge and stakes.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Task. Clarify your ownership. State what you were responsible for and what made the situation difficult.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Action. Show your decisions. Explain what you did, why you chose it, and how you worked with other people.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Result. Make the outcome concrete. Use a metric, visible change, or lesson that shows what your actions accomplished.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Prepare. Build a small story bank. Practice examples for conflict, ambiguity, failure, leadership, and a proud result.
